    "Dry Bulk Freight": "Capesize: C5TC average improved by USD 7.3/day closing the week at USD 33,932/day. Trip from Continent to F. East is up by 5.7k/day at USD 62,556/day, Transatlantic R/V is higher by 12.9k/ day at USD 37,281/day, and Bolivar to Rotterdam is higher by 12.8k/day at USD 38,726/day, while Transpacific R/V is increased by 8.3k/day at USD 38,602/day. Trip from Tubarao to Rotterdam is increased by 4.5k/day at USD 28,677/day, China- Brazil R/V is higher by 6.1k/day at USD 36,623/ day, and trip from Saldanha Bay to Qinqdao is in- creased by 4.5k/day at USD 28,677/day.\n\nKamsarmax/Panamax: P5TC Timecharter average started the week at USD 16,696/day closing with an increase at USD 17,773/day. Trip from Skaw- Gib to F.East is improved by 1.2k/day at USD 25,821/day, Pacific R/Vis up by 1.7k/day at USD 18,323/day, while Transatlantic R/V is increased by 1.5k/day at USD 14,416/day, and Singapore R/ V via Atlantic is increased by .3k/day at USD 19,013/day.\n\nUltramax/Supramax: S11TC average closed the week about USD 1.3k/day higher than its opening at USD 17,886/day. The Supramax S10TC average closed the week about 1.3k/day higher than its opening at USD 15,852/day. The Baltic Supramax Asia S3TC average closed the week about 1.5k/day higher than previous week at USD 17,793/day. N.China one Australian or Pacific R/V is improved by 0.9k/day at USD 18,006/day, USG to Skaw Passero is firmer by 5k/day at USD 25,327/day. S. China trip via Indonesia to EC India is up by 2.3k/day at USD 19,929/day, trip from S. China via Indonesia to S. China pays USD 15,350/day, while Med/B. Sea to China/S. Korea is reduced by .3k/day at USD 17,867/day.\n\nHandysize: HS7TC average closed the week im- proved by 0.8k/day at USD 13,337/day. Skaw- Passero trip to Boston-Galveston pays .2k/day more at USD 9,986/day, Brazil to Cont. pays 1.4k/ day more at USD 20,700/day, S.E. Asia trip to Spore/Japan 0.9k/day is firmer at USD 14,375/day, China/S.Korea/Japan round trip is increased by 1.2k/day at USD 13,950/day, and trip from U.S. Gulf to Cont. is increased by 0.5k/day at USD 11,986/ day, while N.China-S.Korea-Japan trip to S.E. Asia is increased by 0.7k/day at USD 13,444/day .",
